1. When design process completes (plan written to GitHub issue), append [PLANNED] prefix to the tracking issue title, consistent with [IN PROGRESS], [DONE], [STALLED] bracket convention in tracking-issue-write.sh.
2. /design should create a branch when it starts the process, save all run logs (all DESIGN_TMPDIR content) directly in its branch's larch-logs/design/<run-id>/ directory just like where /implement flushes its logs, and, after completing its work, create a PR that bypasses CI (using [skip ci] in commit message and gh pr merge --squash --admin) and merge it which contains complete run logs of /design. Delete the branch after merge.

